# A turn that stores nothing by name is begun again where a guess fails, and what stands in front of the loop is read in front of its version: neither takes an arm. A turn that stores one property finds its address in front of its version, too, and stores there.
# RUN: walk f1:Body mechanisms=all
# CHECK: = GetValueAtSiteOrAbsent {{*}} key="k"
# CHECK: = GetValueAtSiteOrAbsent {{*}} key="j"
# CHECK: = Add {{*}} form=Numbers
